# Normalise to LF in the repository. The build, the Linux CI checkout, and
# Prettier (endOfLine: lf) all agree on LF; Windows working copies may still
# check out CRLF locally without changing what is stored.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary